### Create a new entity
POST http://localhost:8080/restapi/Countries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "AB",
  "countryName": "Alberta"
}

### GET All entity from REST API endpoint
GET http://localhost:8080/restapi/Countries

### GET One entity from REST API endpoint
GET http://localhost:8080/restapi/Countries/AB

### UPDATE entity at the REST API endpoint - will replace all properties with the properties in the request body
PUT http://localhost:8080/restapi/Countries/AB
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "AB",
  "countryName": "New Alberta"
}

### DELETE entity at the REST API endpoint
DELETE http://localhost:8080/restapi/Countries/AB

{
  "propertyName": "propertyValue"
}